#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:4
msgid "v3.9.0"
msgstr "v3.9.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.9.0 is a major release. It adds the **nRF port** with the **Arduino Nano "
"33 BLE Sense** (camera, PDM :mod:`audio` module, :mod:`ulab`, frozen sensor "
"drivers), brings **FLIR Lepton** plus **MLX90641 / MLX90621** thermal "
"sensors and a heavily reworked :mod:`fir` module, OV5640 **autofocus** "
"ioctls, and the new :class:`image.ImageIO` streaming type. The legacy CMSIS-"
"NN ``nn`` module and the old ``ImageReader`` / ``ImageWriter`` classes were "
"removed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.0 es una versión importante. Añade el **puerto nRF** con la **Arduino "
"Nano 33 BLE Sense** (cámara, módulo :mod:`audio` PDM, :mod:`ulab`, "
"controladores de sensores congelados), incorpora los sensores térmicos "
"**FLIR Lepton** más **MLX90641 / MLX90621** y un módulo :mod:`fir` "
"profundamente reelaborado, los ioctls de **autoenfoque** del OV5640, y el "
"nuevo tipo de transmisión :class:`image.ImageIO`. Se eliminaron el antiguo "
"módulo CMSIS-NN ``nn`` y las antiguas clases ``ImageReader`` / "
"``ImageWriter`` — lee los cambios incompatibles a continuación."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "En esta página"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Aspectos destacados"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** — new nRF52840 port with camera, a PDM "
":mod:`audio` module, :mod:`ulab`, and frozen sensor drivers."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** — nuevo puerto nRF52840 con cámara, un módulo "
":mod:`audio` PDM, :mod:`ulab` y controladores de sensores congelados."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Thermal** — FLIR Lepton, MLX90641, and MLX90621 support with a reworked "
":mod:`fir` module (palettes, mirroring, scaling, radiometry, FFC)."
msgstr ""
"**Térmico** — compatibilidad con FLIR Lepton, MLX90641 y MLX90621 con un "
"módulo :mod:`fir` reelaborado (paletas, espejado, escalado, radiometría, "
"FFC)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:26
msgid "**OV5640 autofocus** — new ``sensor.IOCTL_*_AUTO_FOCUS`` ioctls."
msgstr ""
"**Autoenfoque del OV5640** — nuevos ioctls ``sensor.IOCTL_*_AUTO_FOCUS``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:27
msgid ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — a unified image stream type (memory or file; "
"read/write/seek/size/close) replacing ``ImageReader`` / ``ImageWriter``."
msgstr ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — un tipo unificado de flujo de imágenes (memoria o "
"archivo; read/write/seek/size/close) que reemplaza a ``ImageReader`` / "
"``ImageWriter``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the CMSIS-NN ``nn`` module and ``image.ImageReader`` / "
"``image.ImageWriter`` were removed, and ``find_lines()`` / :mod:`fir` "
"behavior changed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Incompatible:** se eliminaron el módulo CMSIS-NN ``nn`` y "
"``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter``, y cambió el comportamiento de"
" ``find_lines()`` / :mod:`fir` — consulta los cambios incompatibles."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:34
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nuevas características"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:36
msgid ""
"**nRF port / Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** — new nRF52840 port and board "
"support, with a new :mod:`audio` module (:func:`audio.init`, "
":func:`audio.start_streaming`, :func:`audio.stop_streaming`), :mod:`ulab` "
"enabled, and frozen :mod:`apds9960` / :mod:`lps22h` / :mod:`lsm9ds1` / "
":mod:`hts221` sensor drivers."
msgstr ""
"**Puerto nRF / Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** — nuevo puerto nRF52840 y "
"compatibilidad con la placa, con un nuevo módulo :mod:`audio` "
"(:func:`audio.init`, :func:`audio.start_streaming`, "
":func:`audio.stop_streaming`), :mod:`ulab` habilitado y controladores de "
"sensores :mod:`apds9960` / :mod:`lps22h` / :mod:`lsm9ds1` / :mod:`hts221` "
"congelados."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:41
msgid ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — a new image-stream type supporting both memory and "
"file streams with ``read()`` / ``write()`` / ``seek()`` / ``size()`` / "
"``close()``, plus ImageIO read/write/memory examples."
msgstr ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — un nuevo tipo de flujo de imágenes que admite tanto"
" flujos en memoria como en archivo con ``read()`` / ``write()`` / ``seek()``"
" / ``size()`` / ``close()``, más ejemplos de lectura/escritura/memoria de "
"ImageIO."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:44
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — added ``FIR_LEPTON`` support with ``fir.radiometric()``, "
"``fir.trigger_ffc()``, and ``fir.register_vsync_cb()``."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — se añadió compatibilidad con ``FIR_LEPTON`` con "
"``fir.radiometric()``, ``fir.trigger_ffc()`` y ``fir.register_vsync_cb()``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Thermal sensors** — added MLX90641 (``FIR_MLX90641``) and MLX90621 "
"thermopile support (official Melexis drivers)."
msgstr ""
"**Sensores térmicos** — se añadió compatibilidad con el termopila MLX90641 "
"(``FIR_MLX90641``) y MLX90621 (controladores oficiales de Melexis)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:48
msgid ""
":mod:`fir` palettes / orientation — added ``fir.PALETTE_RAINBOW`` / "
"``PALETTE_IRONBOW`` / ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565`` constants, and "
":func:`fir.read_ir` now accepts ``hmirror`` / ``vflip`` / ``transpose``."
msgstr ""
"Paletas / orientación de :mod:`fir` — se añadieron las constantes "
"``fir.PALETTE_RAINBOW`` / ``PALETTE_IRONBOW`` / ``GRAYSCALE`` / ``RGB565``, "
"y :func:`fir.read_ir` ahora acepta ``hmirror`` / ``vflip`` / ``transpose``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"**OV5640 autofocus** — added ``sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS`` / "
"``IOCTL_PAUSE_AUTO_FOCUS`` / ``IOCTL_RESET_AUTO_FOCUS`` / "
"``IOCTL_WAIT_ON_AUTO_FOCUS`` (OpenMV 2/3/4/4 Plus/PT/Portenta)."
msgstr ""
"**Autoenfoque del OV5640** — se añadieron "
"``sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS`` / ``IOCTL_PAUSE_AUTO_FOCUS`` / "
"``IOCTL_RESET_AUTO_FOCUS`` / ``IOCTL_WAIT_ON_AUTO_FOCUS`` (OpenMV 2/3/4/4 "
"Plus/PT/Portenta)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:54
msgid "Reorganized the Arduino examples into per-board directories."
msgstr "Se reorganizaron los ejemplos de Arduino en directorios por placa."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:57
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Otros cambios y mejoras"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:59
msgid ""
"Switched to compressed MicroPython error messages (shorter exception "
"strings); :func:`fir.init`'s ``type`` argument now auto-detects via an I2C "
"bus scan when omitted; the ``xalloc`` exception now reports the number of "
"bytes requested; UART 8 was enabled on the Portenta; FIR examples were "
"consolidated into ``thermal_camera.py`` / ``thermal_overlay.py`` / "
"``thermal_overlay_lcd.py``. To fit flash, ``image.get_similarity()`` and "
"selective search were disabled on the OpenMV 4 build, and the image library "
"can now be built without a filesystem (for filesystem-less boards)."
msgstr ""
"Se cambió a mensajes de error comprimidos de MicroPython (cadenas de "
"excepción más cortas); el argumento ``type`` de :func:`fir.init` ahora se "
"detecta automáticamente mediante un escaneo del bus I2C cuando se omite; la "
"excepción ``xalloc`` ahora informa del número de bytes solicitados; se "
"habilitó la UART 8 en la Portenta; los ejemplos de FIR se consolidaron en "
"``thermal_camera.py`` / ``thermal_overlay.py`` / ``thermal_overlay_lcd.py``."
" Para caber en la memoria flash, se deshabilitaron "
"``image.get_similarity()`` y la búsqueda selectiva en la compilación del "
"OpenMV 4, y la biblioteca de imágenes ahora se puede compilar sin un sistema"
" de archivos (para placas sin sistema de archivos)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:69
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrección de errores"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:71
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "Cámara y sensores:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:73
msgid ""
"Fixed the OV5640 PCLK calculation, added missing I2C IRQ handlers (fixing "
"I2C transfer hangs), reworked the cambus I2C read/write for reliability, "
"made the Lepton I2C bus selectable, moved cambus bus-recovery pins to per-"
"board config, retry the cambus scan once before failing, and got the OpenMV "
"PT (Lepton + camera shared I2C) working."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigió el cálculo del PCLK del OV5640, se añadieron los manejadores de "
"IRQ I2C que faltaban (corrigiendo los bloqueos en las transferencias I2C), "
"se reelaboró la lectura/escritura I2C del cambus para mayor fiabilidad, se "
"hizo seleccionable el bus I2C del Lepton, se movieron los pines de "
"recuperación del bus del cambus a la configuración por placa, se reintenta "
"el escaneo del cambus una vez antes de fallar, y se logró que el OpenMV PT "
"(Lepton + cámara con I2C compartido) funcionara."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:79
msgid "Thermal:"
msgstr "Térmico:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:81
msgid ""
"Fixed the max-value computation in :mod:`fir` ``get_ir()`` / ``draw_ir()`` "
"and ``image.get_similarity()`` (``FLT_MIN`` → ``-FLT_MAX``), AMG8833 "
"12→16-bit handling, and MLX90621 accuracy (official Melexis driver)."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigió el cálculo del valor máximo en :mod:`fir` ``get_ir()`` / "
"``draw_ir()`` y ``image.get_similarity()`` (``FLT_MIN`` → ``-FLT_MAX``), el "
"manejo de 12→16 bits del AMG8833, y la precisión del MLX90621 (controlador "
"oficial de Melexis)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:85
msgid "Display, audio, and system:"
msgstr "Pantalla, audio y sistema:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"Moved STM32 SPI LCD transfers to HAL SPI callbacks (display reliability), "
"fixed Nano 33 :func:`audio.init` (HF oscillator + PDM ratio so the "
"microphone works), the H7 timer state with the new HAL, nRF ``gc_collect`` "
"and early board init/deinit, and stopped printing the spurious \"uh oh, no "
"preference for overlapping detection\" message during ``find_apriltags()`` /"
" ``find_rects()``."
msgstr ""
"Se trasladaron las transferencias del LCD SPI del STM32 a funciones de "
"retorno (callbacks) de la HAL SPI (fiabilidad de la pantalla), se corrigió "
":func:`audio.init` de la Nano 33 (oscilador HF + ratio PDM para que funcione"
" el micrófono), el estado del temporizador del H7 con la nueva HAL, "
"``gc_collect`` del nRF y la inicialización/desinicialización temprana de la "
"placa, y se dejó de imprimir el mensaje espurio \"uh oh, no preference for "
"overlapping detection\" durante ``find_apriltags()`` / ``find_rects()``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:95
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware y compatibilidad de placas"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** — new nRF52840 board (camera, PDM audio, "
":mod:`ulab`, frozen sensor drivers)."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** — nueva placa nRF52840 (cámara, audio PDM, "
":mod:`ulab`, controladores de sensores congelados)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:99
msgid "**FLIR Lepton**, **MLX90641**, and **MLX90621** thermal sensors."
msgstr "Sensores térmicos **FLIR Lepton**, **MLX90641** y **MLX90621**."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:100
msgid "**OV5640 autofocus** — OpenMV 2/3/4/4 Plus/PT/Portenta."
msgstr "**Autoenfoque del OV5640** — OpenMV 2/3/4/4 Plus/PT/Portenta."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:101
msgid "**Portenta** — UART 8 enabled."
msgstr "**Portenta** — UART 8 habilitada."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:104
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Cambios incompatibles en la API"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.8.0 and v3.9.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Cambios en la API visibles para el usuario entre v3.8.0 y v3.9.0. Alcance: "
"módulos C de Python en ``modules/`` y bibliotecas de Python en "
"``scripts/libraries/``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:109
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Cada cambio está etiquetado con su impacto:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:111
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr ""
"*mayor* — afecta a la mayoría de los scripts que usaban la característica; "
"necesitarás portar código."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:113
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*menor* — API reducida; solo afecta a los scripts que la usaban."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:114
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*comportamiento* — misma API, resultados distintos; vuelve a revisar los "
"scripts ajustados."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:116
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_9_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Los cambios se agrupan por impacto en ese orden. Si solo quieres portar tu "
"código, salta a la :ref:`lista de verificación de migración "
"<v3_9_0_migration>` al final. Cada hash de commit enlaza a su diff en "
"GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:123
msgid "CMSIS-NN ``nn`` module removed *(major)*"
msgstr "Módulo CMSIS-NN ``nn`` eliminado *(mayor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:125
msgid ""
"The CMSIS-NN ``nn`` module was removed, including ``nn.load()``, "
"``net.forward()``, ``net.search()``, and the ``nn_class`` helper. Model "
"inference moves to the TensorFlow Lite (``tf``) module. Scripts that loaded "
"``.network`` models with ``nn`` must be ported to ``tf`` with a TensorFlow "
"Lite model."
msgstr ""
"El módulo CMSIS-NN ``nn`` se eliminó, incluyendo ``nn.load()``, "
"``net.forward()``, ``net.search()`` y el auxiliar ``nn_class``. La "
"inferencia de modelos pasa al módulo de TensorFlow Lite (``tf``). Los "
"scripts que cargaban modelos ``.network`` con ``nn`` deben portarse a ``tf``"
" con un modelo de TensorFlow Lite."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:131
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `fbc767b36 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/fbc767b36>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `fbc767b36 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/fbc767b36>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:136
msgid ""
"``ImageReader`` / ``ImageWriter`` replaced by :class:`image.ImageIO` "
"*(major)*"
msgstr ""
"``ImageReader`` / ``ImageWriter`` reemplazados por :class:`image.ImageIO` "
"*(mayor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:138
msgid ""
"``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter`` and their ``next_frame()`` / "
"``add_frame()`` methods were removed and replaced with the new "
":class:`image.ImageIO` type, which supports both memory and file streams via"
" ``read()`` / ``write()`` / ``seek()`` / ``size()`` / ``close()``. Code "
"using the old reader/writer classes must be ported to :class:`image.ImageIO`"
" (see the renamed ``imageio_read.py`` / ``imageio_write.py`` examples)."
msgstr ""
"``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter`` y sus métodos ``next_frame()``"
" / ``add_frame()`` se eliminaron y reemplazaron con el nuevo tipo "
":class:`image.ImageIO`, que admite tanto flujos en memoria como en archivo a"
" través de ``read()`` / ``write()`` / ``seek()`` / ``size()`` / ``close()``."
" El código que usa las antiguas clases reader/writer debe portarse a "
":class:`image.ImageIO` (consulta los ejemplos renombrados "
"``imageio_read.py`` / ``imageio_write.py``)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:145
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `783a78754 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/783a78754>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `783a78754 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/783a78754>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:150
msgid ":func:`fir.draw_ir` ``scale`` keyword removed *(minor)*"
msgstr "Palabra clave ``scale`` de :func:`fir.draw_ir` eliminada *(menor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:152
msgid ""
":func:`fir.draw_ir` was rewritten on top of the new image drawing pipeline. "
"The ``scale=(min, max)`` keyword was removed, and ``hint``, ``x_scale``, "
"``y_scale``, ``roi``, and positional x/y offset arguments were added. "
"Scripts that passed ``scale=(min, max)`` to :func:`fir.draw_ir` must drop it"
" and use the new arguments."
msgstr ""
":func:`fir.draw_ir` se reescribió sobre el nuevo pipeline de dibujo de "
"imágenes. La palabra clave ``scale=(min, max)`` se eliminó, y se añadieron "
"los argumentos ``hint``, ``x_scale``, ``y_scale``, ``roi`` y los "
"desplazamientos posicionales x/y. Los scripts que pasaban ``scale=(min, "
"max)`` a :func:`fir.draw_ir` deben omitirla y usar los nuevos argumentos."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:158
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `0a29103b1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0a29103b1>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `0a29103b1 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0a29103b1>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:163
msgid "``find_lines()`` approximation *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Aproximación de ``find_lines()`` *(comportamiento)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:165
msgid ""
"``image.find_lines()`` now approximates gradient magnitude as ``(abs(gx) + "
"abs(gy)) / 2`` and skips magnitudes below 126. This is faster but changes "
"the set of detected lines and accumulator values, so re-check and re-tune "
"``threshold`` / ``theta_margin`` / ``rho_margin``."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_lines()`` ahora aproxima la magnitud del gradiente como "
"``(abs(gx) + abs(gy)) / 2`` y omite las magnitudes por debajo de 126. Esto "
"es más rápido pero cambia el conjunto de líneas detectadas y los valores del"
" acumulador, así que vuelve a revisar y reajustar ``threshold`` / "
"``theta_margin`` / ``rho_margin``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:170
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `902ae3c98 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/902ae3c98>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `902ae3c98 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/902ae3c98>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:175
msgid ":func:`fir.snapshot` reworked *(behavior)*"
msgstr ":func:`fir.snapshot` reelaborado *(comportamiento)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:177
msgid ""
":func:`fir.snapshot` was substantially reworked with a new keyword API "
"(``hmirror``, ``vflip``, ``transpose``, ``x_scale``, ``y_scale``, "
"``x_size``, ``y_size``, ``scale``, ``rgb_channel``, ``alpha``, "
"``color_palette``, ``hint``, ``pixformat``, ``copy_to_fb``), and the bundled"
" examples were rewritten. The previous positional/``pixformat``-only "
"behavior changed; port FIR scripts to the new keyword form (see the updated "
"thermopile-shield examples)."
msgstr ""
":func:`fir.snapshot` se reelaboró sustancialmente con una nueva API de "
"palabras clave (``hmirror``, ``vflip``, ``transpose``, ``x_scale``, "
"``y_scale``, ``x_size``, ``y_size``, ``scale``, ``rgb_channel``, ``alpha``, "
"``color_palette``, ``hint``, ``pixformat``, ``copy_to_fb``), y los ejemplos "
"incluidos se reescribieron. El comportamiento anterior posicional/solo "
"``pixformat`` cambió; porta los scripts de FIR a la nueva forma de palabras "
"clave (consulta los ejemplos actualizados del shield termopila)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:185
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `53f2248b8 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/53f2248b8>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `53f2248b8 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/53f2248b8>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:190
msgid ":func:`fir.init` raises on failure *(behavior)*"
msgstr ":func:`fir.init` genera una excepción al fallar *(comportamiento)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:192
msgid ""
":func:`fir.init` now raises (and cleanly de-inits) when the thermal sensor "
"is not detected, instead of silently continuing. Wrap :func:`fir.init` in "
"``try`` / ``except`` (or ensure the sensor is connected) where you "
"previously relied on it not raising."
msgstr ""
":func:`fir.init` ahora genera una excepción (y se desinicializa limpiamente)"
" cuando no se detecta el sensor térmico, en lugar de continuar "
"silenciosamente. Envuelve :func:`fir.init` en ``try`` / ``except`` (o "
"asegúrate de que el sensor esté conectado) donde antes confiabas en que no "
"generara una excepción."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:197
msgid ""
