#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:204
msgid "For a clean port to v3.9.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para una portación limpia a v3.9.0, el trabajo típico es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:206
msgid ""
"Port CMSIS-NN ``nn`` model inference to the TensorFlow Lite ``tf`` module "
"(:ref:`the nn removal <v3_9_0_nn>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porta la inferencia de modelos CMSIS-NN ``nn`` al módulo de TensorFlow Lite "
"``tf`` (:ref:`la eliminación de nn <v3_9_0_nn>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:208
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter`` with "
":class:`image.ImageIO` (:ref:`the ImageIO change <v3_9_0_imageio>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reemplaza ``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter`` por "
":class:`image.ImageIO` (:ref:`el cambio de ImageIO <v3_9_0_imageio>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:210
msgid ""
"Drop the ``scale=(min, max)`` keyword from :func:`fir.draw_ir` and use the "
"new arguments (:ref:`the draw_ir change <v3_9_0_fir_draw_ir>`)."
msgstr ""
"Omite la palabra clave ``scale=(min, max)`` de :func:`fir.draw_ir` y usa los"
" nuevos argumentos (:ref:`el cambio de draw_ir <v3_9_0_fir_draw_ir>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:212
msgid ""
"Re-tune ``find_lines()`` parameters against the approximate magnitude metric"
" (:ref:`the find_lines change <v3_9_0_find_lines>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reajusta los parámetros de ``find_lines()`` contra la métrica de magnitud "
"aproximada (:ref:`el cambio de find_lines <v3_9_0_find_lines>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Port FIR scripts to the new :func:`fir.snapshot` keyword API (:ref:`the "
"fir.snapshot change <v3_9_0_fir_snapshot>`) and handle :func:`fir.init` "
"raising on a missing sensor (:ref:`the fir.init change <v3_9_0_fir_init>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porta los scripts de FIR a la nueva API de palabras clave de "
":func:`fir.snapshot` (:ref:`el cambio de fir.snapshot "
"<v3_9_0_fir_snapshot>`) y maneja que :func:`fir.init` genere una excepción "
"ante un sensor ausente (:ref:`el cambio de fir.init <v3_9_0_fir_init>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:219
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Todos los demás scripts se ejecutan sin cambios."
